@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Reject pathological ``Content-Length`` header values with more than 16
+digits as an ``h11.ProtocolError`` instead of attempting a slow ``int()``
+conversion or surfacing a raw ``ValueError`` on newer Python versions.
